- (3) All prudential and exposure norms under clause 8, shall be applicable at the level of individual segregated fund at SFIN level. 

- (4) Insurer shall, as per circular / guidelines issued, from time to time, disclose on their website, the minimum information required for the benefit of policyholders. 

