4. Item (K) shall be determined shall be the sum total of the Required Solvency Margins arrived in the manner as specified under Form KT-1 and KT-2 of Part III (B) of Schedule-I of Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India (Actuarial, Finance and Investment Functions of Insurers) Regulations, 2024. 

5. Item (L) shall be determined as per clause 2 of Part V of Schedule-I of these regulations 

